    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50241" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vastātor</span></b> , ōris,
			m.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a
				desolater</i>, <i>ravager</i>, <i>devastater</i> (mostly <b>poet.</b>): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Arcadiae aper,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
					9, 192</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ferus (i. e. lupus),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					ib. 11, 395</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ferarum Amycus,</span>”
				<i>destroyer</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 9, 772</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Trojae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Stat. Achill. 2, 318</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">gentium (Alexander),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Ben. 1, 13, 3</span></i>
			.</div>
